    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii oo dhammu iyagoo ah sidii nin keliya ayay dhammaantood ku soo wada urureen meesha bannaan oo iridda biyaha ka horraysa; oo karraanigii Cesraa ahaa ayay kula hadleen oo u sheegeen inuu keeno kitaabkii sharciga Muuse oo Rabbigu ku amray reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa wadaadkii Cesraa sharcigii hor keenay ururkii ahaa rag iyo dumar iyo in alla intii waxgarasho ku maqli kartay oo dhan, oo waxayna ahayd bishii toddobaad maalinteedii kowaad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wixii kitaabkii ku qornaa ayuu ku akhriyey meeshii bannaanayd oo iridda biyaha ka horraysay, oo wuxuu akhriyeyey aroortii ilaa hadhkii, wuxuuna ku hor akhriyey raggii iyo dumarkii iyo kuwii garan karayay; oo dadkii oo dhammuna aad bay u dhegaysanayeen kitaabkii sharciga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo karraanigii Cesraa ahaa wuxuu kor taagnaa meel sare oo alwaax laga sameeyey oo sababtaas aawadeed loo dhisay; oo dhankiisa midigta waxaa taagnaa Matityaah, iyo Shemac, iyo Canaayaah, iyo Uuriyaah, iyo Xilqiyaah, iyo Macaseeyaah; oo dhankiisa bidixdana waxaa taagnaa Fedaayaah, iyo Miishaa'eel, iyo Malkiyaah, iyo Xaashum, iyo Xashbaddaanaah, iyo Sekaryaah, iyo Meshullaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Cesraa kitaabkii furay iyadoo dadkii oo dhammu wada arkaan, (waayo, wuu ka wada korreeyey dadka oo dhan;) oo markuu furay ayaa dadkii oo dhammu wada istaagay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa Cesraa ammaanay Rabbiga ah Ilaaha weyn, oo dadkii oo dhammuna intay gacmaha kor u qaadeen ayay ku jawaabeen, Aamiin, Aamiin; oo intay madaxa foororiyeen ayay Rabbiga u sujuudeen oo wejiga dhulka saareen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba waxaa kaloo dadkii sharciga garansiiyey Yeeshuuca, iyo Baanii, iyo Sheereebyaah, iyo Yaamiin, iyo Caquub, iyo Shabbetay, iyo Hoodiyaah, iyo Macaseeyaah, iyo Qeliitaa, iyo Casaryaah, iyo Yoosaabaad, iyo Xaanaan, iyo Felaayaah, iyo kuwii reer Laawi, oo dadkiina meeshoodii ayay istaageen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kitaabkii sharciga Ilaah si bayaan ah ayaa loo akhriyey, waana la micneeyey si dadku u garto waxa la akhriyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Nexemyaah oo taliyaha ahaa, iyo wadaadkii Cesraa oo karraaniga ahaa, iyo kuwii reer Laawi oo dadka wax bari jiray, waxay dadkii oo dhan ku wada yidhaahdeen, Maanta waxay Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah u tahay maalin quduus ah, haddaba ha barooranina, hana ooyina, maxaa yeelay, dadkii oo dhammu way wada ooyeen markay maqleen erayadii sharciga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu iyagii ku yidhi, Taga, oo baruurta cuna, oo wax macaan cabba, oo kii aan wax u diyaarsanaynna qayb u dira, waayo, maanta waxay Rabbigeenna u tahay maalin quduus ah, hana murugoonina, waayo, idinka waxaa xoog idiin ah farxadda Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba kuwii reer Laawi ayaa dadkii oo dhan aamusiiyey, oo waxay ku yidhaahdeen, War maanta waa quduuse iska aamusa oo ha murugoonina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay dadkii oo dhammu iska tageen inay wax cunaan, oo wax cabbaan, oo ay qaybo diraan, oo ay aad u farxaan, maxaa yeelay, waxay garteen erayadii loo caddeeyey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo madaxdii qabiilooyinka dadka oo dhan, iyo wadaaddadii, iyo kuwii reer Laawi ayaa maalintii labaad karraanigii Cesraa ugu soo wada urureen inay erayada sharciga aad u dhegaystaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa sharcigii ku qornaa oo ay ka dhex heleen in Rabbigu Muuse ku amray in reer binu Israa'iil ay waabab ku hoydaan inta lagu jiro iidda bisha toddobaad, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo inay iyaga waajib ku tahay inay kaga dhawaaqaan oo ka naadiyaan magaalooyinkooda oo dhan iyo xataa Yeruusaalem gudaheeda, oo ay yidhaahdaan, Buurta taga oo ka soo gura laamo saytuun ah, iyo kuwo saytuun dibadeed ah, iyo laamo ah geedo hadaas la yidhaahdo, iyo laamo cawbaar ah, iyo geedo waaweyn laamahood in laga sameeyo waabab sida qoran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed dadkii way bexeen, oo laamihii keeneen, oo waxay dhisteen waabab, oo mid waluba wuxuu ka dhistay saqafka gurigiisa, iyo barxadahooda, iyo barxadihii guriga Ilaah, iyo meeshii bannaanayd oo Iridda Biyaha, iyo meeshii bannaanayd oo Iridda Efrayim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kulli intii maxaabiisnimada ka soo noqotay ururkoodii oo dhammu waxay dhisteen waabab oo waxay degeen waababkii; waayo, reer binu Israa'iil saas ma ay yeelin tan iyo wakhtigii Yashuuca ina Nuun iyo ilaa maalintaas. Oo ayaantaas waxaa jirtay farxad aad u weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintii ugu horraysay ilaa maalintii ugu dambaysay ayuu maalin kasta kitaabkii sharciga Ilaah akhriyi jiray. Oo toddoba maalmood way iidayeen, oo maalintii siddeedaadna waxaa jiray shir iidda lagu dhammaynayay sida qaynuunka waafaqsanayd.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
